<title>GERMANY: BOXING-HILL WINS UNIFICATION BOUT.</title>
<headline>BOXING-HILL WINS UNIFICATION BOUT.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virgil Hill of the United States beat Henry Maske of Germany on a split points decision in a unification bout for the IBF and WBA world light-heavyweight titles on Saturday.</p>
</text>
